title: Coup in Heartland
subtitle: The President attempts to overthrow the Heartland government.
view-if: president = "DuFour" and in_popular_front_heartland and reichsexekution >= 3 and not presidential_powers and heartland_coup_seen = 0 and heartland_reichsexekution = 0
on-arrival: heartland_reichsexekution = 1; strife += 2; dufour_angry += 15
new-page: true
tags: event
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/Commonwealth Army.jpg

= Coup in Heartland

A crisis! President [+ president +] has invoked the <i>Commonwealth intervention</i> to dismiss the Heartland government, citing its "inability to maintain order" amidst escalating clashes between the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span>, the Banners, and the increasingly militant <span style="color: #700000;">**Vanguard**</span>. However, the true motivation is clear: the left-wing coalition governing Heartland poses a direct threat to the conservative and nationalist establishment in the Commonwealth.

The legality of this action remains highly questionable. The left-wing coalition has vowed to resist, while the streets are descending into chaos with mass protests and rising political violence.

- @defend
- @surrender


@defend
title: Fight against the overthrow attempt!
subtitle: Labor will call a general strike. The Banners and the loyal elements of the Heartland police will resist the coup. The <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> remains unwavering in its support.

The Commonwealth Army and <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> are already surrounding Axton, and the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> is supporting them. This could be civil war. We do realize that, correct? 

- @defend_2: We will fight, even if it leads to a civil war.
- @surrender

@defend_2
on-arrival: resist_coup = 1; defense_strength = banner_strength*banner_militancy*(1-dissent/2); defense_strength += heartland_police_strength*heartland_police_militancy*heartland_police_loyalty if marcher_heartland; enemy_strength = loyalist_strength*loyalist_militancy + warden_strength*warden_militancy; enemy_strength += army_strength*army_militancy*(1-army_loyalty); defense_strength += commons_marcher_normalized*(2 - dissent)*(2 - disfavored/100); defense_strength += vanguard_strength*vanguard_militancy*(collectivist_relation/100)
go-to: defend_2_civil_war if defense_strength < enemy_strength; defend_2_victory if defense_strength >= enemy_strength

@defend_2_victory
on-arrival: loyalist_strength *= 0.8; warden_strength *= 0.8; pro_republic += 6; commons_marcher += 4; disfavored_marcher += 4; commons_collectivist += 2; disfavored_collectivist += 2; commons_royalist -= 6; disfavored_royalist -= 6; coup_victory = 1; ddp_cohesion += 2; ddp_left += 2; ddp_relation += 3; lvp_relation += 3; lvp_left += 1; unionist_relation += 3; collectivist_relation += 10; vanguard_strength += 200; vanguard_militancy += 0.1
achievement: bollwerk_der_demokratie
go-to: defend_2_victory_2

Our combined forces confront the government troops and their <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> auxiliaries, and somehow, our enemies retreat without a fight! They were overwhelmed by our display of strength, and have chosen to slink away. President [+ president +] withdraws the dismissal of the Heartland government, at least for now.

The show of force has reinvigorated support for the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>, and has weakened the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Sovereigntists</span>.

@defend_2_victory_2
achievement: drei_pfeile


@defend_2_civil_war

Our forces confront the government troops and their supporters on the streets of Axton, and armed fighting erupts. The <span style="color: #808080;">reactionaries</span> do not budge from their positions. We are caught at a disadvantage.

- @civil_war: It is a civil war.




@surrender
title: Give up on the Heartland government.
subtitle: The <span style="color: #700000;">**Vanguard**</span> will fight alone.
on-arrival: in_right_coalition_heartland = 0; in_weimar_coalition_heartland = 0; in_grand_coalition_heartland = 0; in_popular_front_heartland = 0; in_left_front_heartland = 0; in_marcher_majority_heartland = 0; in_center_right_coalition_heartland = 0; in_minority_weimar_coalition_heartland = 0; marcher_heartland = 0; heartland_leader = "Goodlake"; commons_marcher -= 5; commons_collectivist -= 5; disfavored_collectivist -= 5; disfavored_marcher -= 5; left_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 10; banner_militancy = banner_militancy/2; banner_strength -= 1000; vanguard_banned = 1; vanguard_strength -= 200; vanguard_militancy -= 0.25; collectivist_relation -= 30; communist_coalition -= 3; next_election_time_heartland = time + 48; next_election_year_heartland = year + 4

The <span style="color: #700000;">collectivists</span> who resist are brutally suppressed, and without the support of the Banners, we are forced to surrender the Heartland government to the <span style="color: #808080;">reactionaries</span>. A pall of hopelessness and despair descends over <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformism</span>. We have failed. The <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> will never trust us again. Many in the Banners simply quit, demoralized by their leaders' lack of a call to action.

DuFour appoints the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalist</span> Reynold Goodlake, who renounces his party affiliation, to govern over Heartland as a <i>Commonwealth Commissioner</i>, charged with dismantling the democratic systems we worked hard to build.